          "highlight": [
            "consequently"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "幾座機場夜間關閉；結果航班被改道。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "By overlooking these warnings, the council consequently faced a massive lawsuit.",
          "highlight": [
            "consequently"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "議會忽視了這些警告，結果面臨龐大訴訟。"
